      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.7.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Restores Skylight sign-in. Skylight's authorization endpoint now requires PKCE, and the app was requesting an authorization code without it, so sign-in failed with HTTP 400. Also recovers from a first-sign-in Keychain case where an existing credential item could not be updated.</p>]]></description>
